# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# Models are large (2.4GB+) and volume-mounted, never committed
/models/
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
*.bin
tokenizer.model

# Audio fixtures can be large; golden test fixtures are kept.
# The negation needs `**` -- the fixtures live under crates/<name>/tests/, and
# a leading path without it only matches at the repository root, so the golden
# fixture was silently untracked and `cargo test --test golden` could not run
# from a fresh clone.
*.wav
!**/tests/fixtures/golden/*.wav

# Local config containing the shared auth token
config.local.toml
.env
# Baked into the iOS app at build time; holds the server token.
ios/Local.xcconfig
# Generated from ios/project.yml by xcodegen -- machine-managed UUIDs.
ios/*.xcodeproj/
ios/build/

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
# Only the one at the root: that is the local server config, with a token in
# it. A bare `config.toml` also matched docker/config.toml, which the image
# needs -- so a clone had no config to COPY and the build failed there while
# working here.
/config.toml
